amed after the Origami "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"patch","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", bare (no prefix) —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"disambiguate with the module ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrigamiPatterns.Interaction"},{"type":"text","text":") if it ever collides. This one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t clash with anything in SwiftUI."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Exposes the Interaction patch’s output ports as bindings\/callbacks so downstream SwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"composes off them, matching the graph:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"down"},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" while a finger is on the layer,"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"text":" — the touch point, in the layer’s coordinate space,","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onTap"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDoubleTap"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onLongPress"},{"type":"text","text":" — discrete pulses."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Only the gesture for an output you actually request is attached — so a tap-only layer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carries only a tap recognizer (no stray drag), which keeps gesture arbitration clean.","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP","title":"SwiftUICore.ViewModifier","type":"unresolvab